From af65b530e0dafcf6c965df6619fdf7eae1ee29a3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Codex <codex@openai.com>
Date: Mon, 31 Aug 2026 04:31:46 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 01/11] JIT: port guarded metatable specialization

Semantically adapts DreamWeave-MP/rubic0n 6a297e50c1a49a1219842c315ace991a0f1eb00a onto exact stable-P0 LuaJIT 707c12bf. The unrelated compile-unpack function absent from stock was not imported.
---
 src/lj_ffrecord.c |  8 ++++++++
 src/lj_record.c   | 39 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++------
 src/lj_record.h   |  1 +
 3 files changed, 42 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/lj_ffrecord.c b/src/lj_ffrecord.c
index 3c4d4eb..e513f7a 100644
